Bookloom bundles Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC) dictionary data for offline
Traditional/Simplified Chinese conversion.

Upstream: https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC
Release tag: ver.1.4.2
Tag object: d5e960a8f60aa62fb252f48a23a577acb242f3f0
