The unmodified upstream files in assets/opencc/ are:
  data/config/t2s.json, data/config/s2twp.json
  data/dictionary/CJK_Compatibility_Ideographs.txt
  data/dictionary/TSPhrases.txt, TSCharacters.txt
  data/dictionary/STPhrases.txt, STCharacters.txt
  data/dictionary/TWPhrases.txt, TWVariantsPhrases.txt, TWVariants.txt

TSCharactersExt.txt was generated from the tagged TSCharacters.txt using
upstream data/scripts/extract_tofu_risk.py.
STPhrases_GeneratedFromRegionalPhrases.txt was generated from the tagged
HKPhrases.txt and TWPhrases.txt keys using the tagged t2s.json conversion
chain, following upstream data/scripts/generate_st_phrases_from_regional_phrases.py.
The generated resource includes the upstream attribution header.

CJK_Compatibility_Ideographs.txt identifies UnicodeData.txt as its source
in its upstream header; that header is preserved in the bundled file.
